  m_text: 'This is the ultimate test! This has everything the other tests had. Possession,
    enemies, etc. Test it all!


    1) Possession and depossession.

    2) Possessed
    firing.

    3) Dying while possessed.

    4) Pathing.

    5) Unit spawning.

    6)
    Units fighting one another.

    7) Units capturing crates.

    8) Units destroying
    enemy HQ.

    9) Game over and restart.'
